spec_version: v1.4
identifier: RealBattery
name: RealBattery Recharged
abstract: Realistic battery simulation for KSP - storage (StoredCharge) and power (ElectricCharge), chemistry-based variants, wear, thermal effects and tech progression. Continuation of Blackliner's RealBattery.
$kref: '#/ckan/github/Rjoande/RealBattery'
$vref: '#/ckan/ksp-avc'
